== Trivia ==
* A [[wikipedia:eucharist|eucharist]] is a Christian rite in which bread and wine are transubstantiated into the body and blood of Jesus Christ on an altar and consumed thereafter.
* "Peace be with you" is the phrase stated by a person when administering the rite of eucharist.

